 3 attempts in total, waiting 0.5 s after the first failure and 1 s after the second.\n\n- **Settings:** two new constructor arguments, `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. Existing calls work unchanged.\n- **What's retried:** only HTTP 503. Other HTTP errors (404, 500, etc.) and network errors such as timeouts or refused connections are raised straight away.\n- **If all 3 attempts get a 503:** the last 503 error is raised to the caller.\n\nI checked it against a local test server:\n\n| Server behaviour | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| Healthy | returns the data | 1 |\n| 503 twice, then OK | returns the data | 3 |\n| 503 every time | raises the 503 | 3 |\n| 404 | raises the 404 straight away | 1 |\n\nNo test file was added; the repo has no test suite.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 35427, "requests_cache_write": 142853, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7543184000000001, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1646, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial5", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 9, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T04:36:49.298197+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 20.517, "t_checker_s": 1.938, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1658, "tokens_cache_read": 35427, "tokens_cache_write": 142853, "tokens_fresh": 1658, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 35427, "tokens_main_cache_write": 142853, "tokens_main_calls": 5, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_ou